<title>USA: Swissray to boost number of shares.</title>
<headline>Swissray to boost number of shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissray International Inc said on Tuesday that its shareholders approved an increase in the number of authorized shares to 30 million from 15 million.</p>
<p>Also, Swissray said Ruedi Laupper, president and chief executive officer, was elected to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
</text>
